    "account_disabled"|"card_active"|"card_canceled"|"card_expired"|"card_inactive"|"cardholder_blocked"|"cardholder_inactive"|"cardholder_verification_required"|"insecure_authorization_method"|"insufficient_funds"|"network_fallback"|"not_allowed"|"pin_blocked"|"spending_controls"|"stripe_internal_error"|"suspected_fraud"|"verification_failed"|"webhook_approved"|"webhook_declined"|"webhook_error"|"webhook_timeout" reason;
    # The `pending_request.amount` at the time of the request, presented in your card's currency and in the [smallest currency unit](https://docs.stripe.com/currencies#zero-decimal). Stripe held this amount from your account to fund the authorization if the request was approved
